{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Orb of Deception|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Ahri
|skill        = Q
|icon         = Orb of Deception.png
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Ahri''' sends her orb in the target direction that deals {{as|magic damage}} to enemies it passes through. Upon reaching maximum range, it returns to her to deal the same amount in {{sti|{{as|true damage}}}} to enemies it passes through.
|leveling     = {{st|Damage Per Pass|{{ap|35 to 135}} {{as|(+ 50% AP)}}|Total Mixed Damage|{{ap|35*2 to 135*2}} {{as|(+ {{ap|50*2}}% AP)}}}}
|description2 = ''Enemies can be hit only once per pass.''
|range        = {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|900|Without return point aoe}}
|width        = {{tip|er|icononly = true}} 200
|effect radius= {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|100|Circle check at return point}}
|speed        = {{dv|{{tt|1550|Outgoing missile}}|{{tt|60 - 2600|Returning missile, acceleration 1900}}}}
|cast time    = {{fd|0.25}}
|cooldown     = 7
|cost         = {{ap|55 to 95}}
|costtype     = mana
|targeting    = Direction
|affects      = Enemies
|damagetype   = Magic True
|spellshield  = Special
|spelleffects = Area of effect
|projectile   = True
|notes        = 
* ''Orb of Deception'' will hit additional units around the return point in a small circle when the orb turns around.
** This applies both to the initial and return missile's damage, but the initial missile only deals damage if the unit was not hit by it already.
* Each pass of the projectile can only damage an enemy once.
* If '''Ahri''' dies while the orb is out, the orb will visually disappear but continue to deal damage and return to '''Ahri'''.{{bug}}
{{Effect at cast time end}}
* This ability's damage is calculated based on the caster's current stats and changes dynamically.
<!--Blurb-->
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Ahri}} sends out her orb, dealing {{as|magic damage}} to enemies it passes through. After a point, the orb travels back to her, dealing the same amount in {{as|true damage}} to enemies it passes through.
}}

{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Twilight Shroud|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Akali
|skill        = W
|disp_name    = Twilight Shroud
|icon         = Twilight Shroud.png
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Akali''' restores {{sti|{{as|100 energy}}}} over {{fd|0.4}} seconds and gains {{sti|ms|{{as|'''bonus''' movement speed}}}} that decays over 2 seconds. She also detonates a smoke bomb a fixed distance away in the target direction, creating a circular shroud that expands over the next 5 seconds into a ring. The shroud does not permeate terrain, and will expand toward nearby enemy champions. While the shroud is active, '''Akali's''' {{as|'''maximum''' energy}} is increased by {{as|100|energy}}.
|leveling     = {{st|Bonus Movement Speed|{{ap|30 to 50}}%}}
{{st|Shroud Duration|{{ap|5 to 7}} seconds}}
|description2 = Entering the shroud renders '''Akali''' {{tip|invisibility|invisible}}, unless she is {{tip|dash|dashing}}.
|description3 = Declaring a basic attack or casting an ability will break the invisibility and prevent '''Akali''' from entering it again for {{pp|changedisplay=true|round=3|1;0.9;0.825;0.725;0.625|1;7;10;13;16}} seconds, refreshing on subsequent attacks and casts.
|description4 = ''The {{ai|Shuriken Flip|Akali|marked}} section of Twilight Shroud will linger for the mark's duration, even after the shroud ends.''
|description5 = '''''Akali''' can move during Twilight Shroud's cast time.''
|target range = 250
|effect radius= {{dv|{{tt|350|Minimum radius. Estimated.}}|{{tt|1175|Maximum radius. Estimated.}}}}
|speed        = <!--{{tt|X|Expansion speed}}-->
|cooldown     = {{ap|20 to 16}}
|cdstart      = post-effect
|cast time    = {{fd|0.25}}
|queue time   = {{fd|0.5}}
|targeting    = Direction
|affects      = Self, Enemies
|notes        = 
* '''Akali''' will also not gain the {{tip|invisibility}} if she is {{si|Recall|Recalling}}.
* It is possible for '''Akali''' to detonate the smoke bomb on the far side of terrain from her current location.
* ''Twilight Shroud's'' effects begin at the start of the cast time.
* Using a basic attack breaks the stealth at the start of the attack windup.
<!-- Blurb -->
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Akali}} restores {{as|{{sti|energy}}}} and gains a brief burst of {{sti|ms|{{as|move speed}}}}. She also drops a smoke shroud that makes her {{tip|invisibility|invisible}}, attacking or using abilities will briefly reveal her.
|blurb2      = The shroud will expand into a ring over a few seconds, during which '''Akali''' gains increased {{as|energy}}.
}}

